{"id":"huntik:page:2737","page_id":2737,"title":"Golem's Attic","kind":"location","namespace":0,"summary":"The Golem's Attic is a building located on the Road of Alchemists in Prague, Czech Republic, in which Jodis Lore was assumed to have lived. The door was protected with magic so that only Jodis Lore's Key could open the door. Inside, he kept his notes on the Amulet of Will and his Metagolem amulet hidden [Words of Truth, Heart of Lies]. It was later converted into a safehouse by the Organization where they stored information on artifacts in their archive terminal. Lok Lambert, Sophie Casterwill and Cherit broke in here looking for info on the location of Void but were discovered and captured by Wilder and his Suits. [Chasing Void]","profile":{"image":{"text":"File:S2E31_Golems_Attic.jpg","wikitext":"File:S2E31_Golems_Attic.jpg","links":[]},"imagewidth":{"text":"250","wikitext":"250","links":[]},"type":{"text":"Organization safehouse","wikitext":"[[Organization]] safehouse","links":[{"target_title":"Organization","label":"Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"}]},"level":{"text":"","wikitext":"","links":[]},"titan":{"text":"Metagolem","wikitext":"[[Metagolem]]","links":[{"target_title":"Metagolem","label":"Metagolem","target_id":"huntik:page:2143","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Metagolem","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2143"}]},"location":{"text":"Prague, Czech Republic","wikitext":"[[Prague, Czech Republic]]","links":[{"target_title":"Prague, Czech Republic","label":"Prague, Czech Republic","target_id":"huntik:page:8072","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Prague%2C_Czech_Republic","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Prague%2C%20Czech%20Republic"}]},"inhabitants":{"text":"Suits","wikitext":"[[Suits]]","links":[{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_