%2C%20Czech%20Republic"}]},{"name":"inhabitants","value_wikitext":"[[Suits]]","value_text":"Suits","links":[{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"}]},{"name":"former","value_wikitext":"[[Jodis Lore]] †","value_text":"Jodis Lore †","links":[{"target_title":"Jodis Lore","label":"Jodis Lore","target_id":"huntik:page:2672","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Jodis_Lore","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2672"}]},{"name":"first appearance","value_wikitext":"\"[[Words of Truth, Heart of Lies]]\"","value_text":"\"Words of Truth, Heart of Lies\"","links":[{"target_title":"Words of Truth, Heart of Lies","label":"Words of Truth, Heart of Lies","target_id":"huntik:page:2555","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Words_of_Truth%2C_Heart_of_Lies","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2555"}]}],"start":0,"end":323}],"sections":[{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{gallery}}\n<gallery captionalign=\"left\">\nThe Golem's Attic 3.png|The golem lying on the floor\nThe Golem's Attic 5.png|The hiding place for the [[Metagolem]] [[Amulets|amulet]]\nS2E31_Lok_Sophie_Cherit_Golems_Attic.jpg|The attic as an [[Organization]] safehouse\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Locations]]\n[[Category:Prague, Czech Republic]]\n[[Category:Road of Alchemists]]\n[[Category:Organization bases]]","text":"Image caption: The golem lying on the floor\n\nImage caption: The hiding place for the Metagolem amulet\n\nImage caption: The attic as an Organization safehouse"}],"full_text":"The Golem's Attic is a building located on the Road of Alchemists in Prague, Czech Republic, in which Jodis Lore was assumed to have lived. The door was protected with magic so that only Jodis Lore's Key could open the door. Inside, he kept his notes on the Amulet of Will and his Metagolem amulet hidden [Words of Truth, Heart of Lies]. It was later converted into a safehouse by the Organization where they stored information on artifacts in their archive terminal. Lok Lambert, Sophie Casterwill and Cherit broke in here looking for info on the location of Void but were discovered and captured by Wilder and his Suits. [Chasing Void]\n\nGallery\n\nImage caption: The golem lying on the floor\n\nImage caption: The hiding place for the Metagolem amulet\n\nImage caption: The attic as an Organization safehouse","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox location\n| image       = File:S2E31_Golems_Attic.jpg\n| imagewidth  = 250\n| type        = [[Organization]] safehouse\n| level       = \n| titan = [[Metagolem]]\n| location    = [[Prague, Czech Republic]]\n| inhabitants = [[Suits]]\n| former = [[Jodis Lore]] †\n| first appearance = \"[[Words of Truth, Heart of Lies]]\"\n}}\n\n'''The Golem's Attic''' is a building located on the [[Road of Alchemists]] in [[Prague, Czech Republic]], in which [[Jodis Lore]] was assumed to have lived. The door was protected with magic so that only [[Jodis Lore's Key]] could open the door. Inside, he kept his notes on the [[Amulet of Will]] and his [[Metagolem]] [[Amulets|amulet]] hidden {{source|Words of Truth, Heart of Lies}}. It was later converted into a safehouse by [[the Organization]] where they stored information on artifacts in their archive terminal. [[Lok Lambert]], [[Sophie Casterwill]] and [[Cherit]] broke in here looking for info on the location of [[Void]] but were discovered and captured by [[Wilder]] and his [[Suits]]. {{source|Chasing Void}}\n\n{{clear}}\n==Gallery==\n{{gallery}}\n<gallery captionalign=\"left\">\nThe Golem's Attic 3.png|The golem lying on the floor\nThe Golem's Attic 5.png|The hiding place for the [[Metagolem]] [[Amulets|amulet]]\nS2E31_Lok_Sophie_Cherit_Golems_Attic.jpg|The attic as an [[Organization]] safehouse\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Locations]]\n[[Category:Prague, Czech Republic]]\n[[Category:Road of Alchemists]]\n[[Category:Organization bases]]","categories":["Locat